{
  "title": "Hook (short video)",
  "slug": "hook-short-video",
  "hue": 22,
  "lede": "A hook is the opening of a short video, roughly its first one to three seconds, made to stop a viewer from swiping to the next one.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "kind": "experience",
      "heading": "The 3-second test",
      "body": "<style>\n.hk{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:22px;grid-template-columns:1fr;font-family:var(--ow-font);color:var(--ow-fg)}\n.hk *{box-sizing:border-box}\n@media (min-width:720px){.hk{grid-template-columns:minmax(230px,270px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px;align-items:start}}\n.hk-q{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600}\n.hk-left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}\n.hk-left .hk-q{align-self:stretch}\n.hk-phone{position:relative;width:200px;aspect-ratio:9/16;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;background:#1d1a17;border:6px solid #1d1a17;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--ow-line),0 10px 24px -14px rgba(0,0,0,.45);touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.hk-screen{position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#f4d9b0 0%,#d9a36a 55%,#8a5530 100%)}\n.hk-prog{position:absolute;left:10px;right:10px;top:9px;height:4px;border-radius:9px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);z-index:5;overflow:hidden}\n.hk-prog i{display:block;height:100%;width:100%;background:#fff;border-radius:inherit;transform-origin:left;transform:scaleX(1)}\n.hk-time{position:absolute;right:12px;top:18px;z-index:5;font:700 13px/1 var(--ow-mono);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.5);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.s-loaf{position:absolute;left:50%;top:54%;width:150px;height:110px;margin:-55px 0 0 -75px}\n.s-cap{position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;top:34px;padding:7px 9px;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;color:#1d1a17;font:800 16px/1.2 var(--ow-font);text-align:center;opacity:0}\n.s-avatar{position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:58px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#6b4a33;border:3px solid #fff;opacity:0}\n.s-sub{position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:16px;font:600 12px/1.35 var(--ow-font);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.7);opacity:0}\n.s-pay{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:16px;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:99px;background:#ffd84d;color:#1d1a17;font:800 12px/1.2 var(--ow-font);white-space:nowrap;opacity:0}\n.s-flash{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#fff;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}\n.hk-phone.show .s-cap,.hk-phone.show .s-avatar,.hk-phone.show .s-sub,.hk-phone.show .s-pay{opacity:1}\n.hk-phone.run .s-cap{animation:hkin .25s ease-out .25s both}\n.hk-phone.run .s-avatar{animation:hkin .6s ease-out .4s both}\n.hk-phone.run .s-sub{animation:hkin .5s ease-out 1.3s both}\n.hk-phone.run .s-pay{animation:hkpop .35s ease-out 1.5s both}\n.hk-phone.run.vc .s-loaf{animation:hkzoom 2.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both}\n.hk-phone.run.vc .s-flash{animation:hkflash .35s ease-out both}\n.hk-phone:not(.vc) .s-loaf{opacity:.75;transform:scale(.8)}\n@keyframes hkin{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n@keyframes hkpop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50%) scale(.6)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) scale(1)}}\n@keyframes hkzoom{0%{transform:scale(1.9) rotate(-6deg)}100%{transform:scale(1) rotate(0)}}\n@keyframes hkflash{from{opacity:.9}to{opacity:0}}\n.hk-play{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:6;display:grid;place-items:center;align-content:center;gap:10px;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;background:rgba(29,26,23,.45);color:#fff;font:700 16px/1.2 var(--ow-font);cursor:pointer;width:100%;border-radius:20px}\n.hk-play span.ic{display:grid;place-items:center;width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:#1d1a17;font-size:24px;padding-left:4px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n.hk-play:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fff;outline-offset:-6px}\n.hk-phone[data-state=\"playing\"] .hk-play{display:none}\n.hk-verdict{position:absolute;left:10px;right:10px;bottom:46%;z-index:7;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(29,26,23,.82);color:#fff;font:700 15px/1.3 var(--ow-font);text-align:center;display:none}\n.hk-phone[data-state=\"done\"] .hk-verdict{display:block}\n.hk-phone[data-state=\"done\"] .hk-play{background:rgba(29,26,23,.2);align-content:end;padding-bottom:22px}\n.hk-phone[data-state=\"done\"] .hk-play span.ic{width:44px;height:44px;font-size:17px}\n.hk-acts{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;width:200px}\n.hk-act{appearance:none;flex:1;font:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:650;min-height:44px;padding:8px 6px;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px solid var(--ow-line);background:var(--ow-panel);color:var(--ow-fg);cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation}\n.hk-act.keep:not(:disabled){background:var(--ow-accent);border-color:var(--ow-accent);color:var(--ow-accent-ink)}\n.hk-act:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}\n.hk-act:focus-visible,.hk-sl input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-accent) 55%,transparent);outline-offset:2px}\n.hk-h{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ow-muted)}\n.hk-sl{padding:12px 14px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--ow-line);background:var(--ow-panel)}\n.hk-sl label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:16px;font-weight:650}\n.hk-sl output{font-family:var(--ow-mono);font-weight:500;color:var(--ow-muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.hk-sl input{width:100%;margin:8px 0 6px;height:28px;accent-color:var(--ow-accent);cursor:pointer}\n.hk-els{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}\n.hk-el{font-size:13px;font-weight:650;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px;border:1.5px dashed var(--ow-line);color:var(--ow-muted);transition:all .2s}\n.hk-el.on{border-style:solid;border-color:var(--ow-accent);background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-accent) 14%,transparent);color:var(--ow-fg)}\n.hk-crowd{margin-top:14px}\n.hk-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}\n.hk-big{font-size:15px;font-weight:650;white-space:nowrap}\n.hk-big b{font-family:var(--ow-mono);color:var(--ow-accent);font-size:17px}\n.hk-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(20,minmax(0,18px));justify-content:start;gap:3px;margin:6px 0 0}\n.hk-d{aspect-ratio:3/4;border-radius:3px;border:1.5px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-muted) 45%,var(--ow-line));background:transparent;transition:background .25s,border-color .25s,transform .25s,opacity .25s;opacity:.8;transform:translateY(-2px)}\n.hk-d.st{background:var(--ow-accent);border-color:var(--ow-accent);opacity:1;transform:none}\n.hk-d.you{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--ow-bg),0 0 0 3.5px var(--ow-fg);opacity:1}\n.hk-d.pend{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,var(--ow-line) 0 2px,transparent 2px 4px);border-color:var(--ow-fg)}\n.hk-leg{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--ow-muted)}\n.hk-leg i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:12px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:-1px;border:1.5px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-muted) 45%,var(--ow-line))}\n.hk-leg i.a{background:var(--ow-accent);border-color:var(--ow-accent)}\n.hk-leg i.y{box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px var(--ow-fg);border-color:transparent}\n.hk-feed{margin-top:12px}\n.hk-list{position:relative;margin:4px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;height:calc(5*30px + 4*5px)}\n.hk-it{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:30px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:22px minmax(80px,112px) minmax(0,1fr) 42px;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14px;transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n.hk-it.me{background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-accent) 12%,transparent);font-weight:700}\n.hk-it .rk{font-weight:750;color:var(--ow-muted);text-align:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.hk-it .nm{white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.hk-it .br{height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-line) 70%,transparent);overflow:hidden}\n.hk-it .br i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--ow-muted);border-radius:inherit;transition:width .35s}\n.hk-it.me .br i{background:var(--ow-accent)}\n.hk-it .pc{font-family:var(--ow-mono);font-size:13px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.hk-cut{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:calc(2*35px - 3px);border-top:1.5px dashed var(--ow-muted);pointer-events:none}\n.hk-cut span{position:absolute;right:0;top:-8px;padding:0 6px;background:var(--ow-bg);font-size:11px;line-height:14px;color:var(--ow-muted)}\n.hk-note{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ow-muted)}\n.hk-sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.hk-phone *,.hk-d,.hk-it,.hk-el{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.hk-phone.run .s-cap,.hk-phone.run .s-avatar,.hk-phone.run .s-sub,.hk-phone.run .s-pay{opacity:1}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"hk\">\n  <div class=\"hk-left\">\n    <p class=\"hk-q\" id=\"hk-q\">Press play. You have 3 seconds: keep watching or swipe.</p>\n    <div class=\"hk-phone\" id=\"hk-phone\" data-state=\"idle\" aria-label=\"Simulated short video\">\n      <div class=\"hk-screen\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <svg class=\"s-loaf\" viewBox=\"0 0 150 110\"><ellipse cx=\"75\" cy=\"96\" rx=\"66\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,.18)\"/><path d=\"M12 84c-6-34 22-62 63-62s69 28 63 62c-1 7-6 10-13 10H25c-7 0-12-3-13-10z\" fill=\"#b8733c\"/><path d=\"M22 76c2-26 24-44 53-44s51 18 53 44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8b47a\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M48 40l14 18 8-22 10 24 16-16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5a3218\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n        <div class=\"s-avatar\"></div>\n        <div class=\"s-cap\" id=\"hk-cap\"></div>\n        <div class=\"s-sub\" id=\"hk-sub\">Hi everyone, so today I want to talk a little bit about bread&hellip;</div>\n        <div class=\"s-pay\">The fix is at the end &darr;</div>\n        <div class=\"s-flash\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hk-prog\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i id=\"hk-bar\"></i></div>\n      <span class=\"hk-time\" id=\"hk-time\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3.0 s</span>\n      <div class=\"hk-verdict\" id=\"hk-verdict\" role=\"status\"></div>\n      <button class=\"hk-play\" id=\"hk-play\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9654;</span><span id=\"hk-pl\">Play</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hk-acts\">\n      <button class=\"hk-act keep\" id=\"hk-keep\" type=\"button\" disabled>Keep watching</button>\n      <button class=\"hk-act\" id=\"hk-swipe\" type=\"button\" disabled>Swipe &uarr;</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"hk-sl\">\n      <label for=\"hk-s\"><span>Hook strength</span><output id=\"hk-o\" for=\"hk-s\">60</output></label>\n      <input id=\"hk-s\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"60\">\n      <ul class=\"hk-els\" aria-label=\"What the opening has\">\n        <li class=\"hk-el\" data-e=\"text\">Text on screen</li>\n        <li class=\"hk-el\" data-e=\"visual\">Visual change</li>\n        <li class=\"hk-el\" data-e=\"question\">A question</li>\n        <li class=\"hk-el\" data-e=\"payoff\">Payoff promise</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <section class=\"hk-crowd\" aria-labelledby=\"hk-ch\">\n      <div class=\"hk-row\"><p class=\"hk-h\" id=\"hk-ch\">100 viewers, 3 s each</p><span class=\"hk-big\"><b id=\"hk-n\">0</b> stayed</span></div>\n      <div class=\"hk-grid\" id=\"hk-grid\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <p class=\"hk-leg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span><i class=\"a\"></i>kept watching</span><span><i></i>swiped</span><span><i class=\"y\"></i>you</span></p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"hk-feed\" aria-labelledby=\"hk-fh\">\n      <p class=\"hk-h\" id=\"hk-fh\">A toy feed that only counts swipes</p>\n      <ol class=\"hk-list\" id=\"hk-list\"><li class=\"hk-cut\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>top 2 go to a bigger audience</span></li></ol>\n      <p class=\"hk-note\">Illustrative: the odds per hook strength and the rival videos are made up, and real feeds weigh many signals. Platforms publish no such numbers.</p>\n    </section>\n    <p class=\"hk-sr\" aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"hk-live\"></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var reduce=window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n  var phone=document.getElementById('hk-phone'),play=document.getElementById('hk-play'),pl=document.getElementById('hk-pl'),keep=document.getElementById('hk-keep'),swipe=document.getElementById('hk-swipe');\n  var bar=document.getElementById('hk-bar'),time=document.getElementById('hk-time'),verdict=document.getElementById('hk-verdict'),cap=document.getElementById('hk-cap'),sub=document.getElementById('hk-sub');\n  var slider=document.getElementById('hk-s'),out=document.getElementById('hk-o'),grid=document.getElementById('hk-grid'),nOut=document.getElementById('hk-n'),list=document.getElementById('hk-list'),live=document.getElementById('hk-live');\n  var seed=7,U=[],dots=[],you=null,raf=0,t0=0,LIMIT=3000;\n  function rnd(){seed=(seed*1103515245+12345)%2147483648;return seed/2147483648}\n  for(var i=0;i<100;i++){U.push(rnd());var d=document.createElement('span');d.className='hk-d';grid.appendChild(d);dots.push(d)}\n  var RIVALS=[{n:'Cat clip',p:.71},{n:'Street food',p:.58},{n:'Gym tip',p:.47},{n:'News bite',p:.34}];\n  var items=RIVALS.concat([{n:'Your short',p:0,me:true}]);\n  items.forEach(function(it){\n    var li=document.createElement('li');li.className='hk-it'+(it.me?' me':'');\n    li.innerHTML='<span class=\"rk\"></span><span class=\"nm\">'+it.n+'</span><span class=\"br\"><i></i></span><span class=\"pc\"></span>';\n    it.el=li;list.appendChild(li);\n  });\n  function els(s){return{text:s>=20,visual:s>=40,question:s>=60,payoff:s>=80}}\n  function odds(s){return .22+.62*s/100}\n  function word(s){return s<20?'weak':s<40?'plain':s<60?'better':s<80?'strong':'very strong'}\n  function scene(){\n    var s=+slider.value,e=els(s);\n    out.textContent=s+' · '+word(s);slider.setAttribute('aria-valuetext',s+', '+word(s));\n    document.querySelectorAll('.hk-el').forEach(function(x){x.classList.toggle('on',e[x.dataset.e])});\n    phone.classList.toggle('vc',e.visual);\n    cap.style.display=e.text?'':'none';cap.textContent=e.question?'Why did my bread split like this?':'My sourdough, day 12';\n    phone.querySelector('.s-avatar').style.display=e.text?'none':'';\n    sub.style.display=e.text?'none':'';\n    phone.querySelector('.s-pay').style.display=e.payoff?'':'none';\n  }\n  function crowd(reveal){\n    var p=odds(+slider.value),n=0;\n    dots.forEach(function(d,i){\n      var st=i===0&&you!==null?you:U[i]<p;\n      d.style.transitionDelay=reveal&&!reduce?(i*9)+'ms':'0ms';\n      d.classList.toggle('st',st);d.classList.toggle('you',i===0);d.classList.toggle('pend',i===0&&you===null);\n      if(st)n++;\n    });\n    nOut.textContent=n;\n    var mine=items[items.length-1];mine.p=n/100;\n    var ranked=items.slice().sort(function(a,b){return b.p-a.p});\n    ranked.forEach(function(it,k){\n      it.el.style.transform='translateY('+(k*35)+'px)';\n      it.el.querySelector('.rk').textContent=k+1;\n      it.el.querySelector('.br i').style.width=Math.round(it.p*100)+'%';\n      it.el.querySelector('.pc').textContent=Math.round(it.p*100)+'%';\n    });\n    return {n:n,rank:ranked.indexOf(mine)+1};\n  }\n  function restart(){phone.classList.remove('run','show');void phone.offsetWidth;phone.classList.add(reduce?'show':'run')}\n  function tick(now){\n    var t=now-t0,left=Math.max(0,LIMIT-t);\n    bar.style.transform='scaleX('+(left/LIMIT)+')';time.textContent=(left/1000).toFixed(1)+' s';\n    if(left<=0){decide(null);return}\n    raf=requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n  function start(){\n    cancelAnimationFrame(raf);you=null;scene();crowd(false);restart();\n    phone.dataset.state='playing';keep.disabled=false;swipe.disabled=false;keep.focus({preventScroll:true});\n    t0=performance.now();raf=requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n  function decide(stayed){\n    if(phone.dataset.state!=='playing')return;\n    cancelAnimationFrame(raf);var t=Math.min(LIMIT,performance.now()-t0)/1000;\n    you=stayed===null?true:stayed;\n    verdict.textContent=stayed===null?'3 s passed: you stayed':stayed?'You kept watching at '+t.toFixed(1)+' s':'You swiped at '+t.toFixed(1)+' s';\n    phone.dataset.state='done';pl.textContent='Play again';keep.disabled=true;swipe.disabled=true;\n    var r=crowd(true);\n    live.textContent=verdict.textContent+'. '+r.n+' of 100 viewers stayed. Your short ranks '+r.rank+' of 5 in the toy feed.';\n    play.focus({preventScroll:true});\n  }\n  play.addEventListener('click',start);\n  keep.addEventListener('click',function(){decide(true)});\n  swipe.addEventListener('click',function(){decide(false)});\n  var y0=null;\n  phone.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){if(phone.dataset.state==='playing'){y0=e.clientY;try{phone.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)}catch(_){}}});\n  phone.addEventListener('pointerup',function(e){if(y0!==null&&y0-e.clientY>30)decide(false);y0=null});\n  slider.addEventListener('input',function(){scene();var r=crowd(false);live.textContent=r.n+' of 100 stayed. Rank '+r.rank+' of 5.'});\n  scene();phone.classList.add('show');crowd(false);\n})();\n</script>\n"
    },
    {
      "heading": "What platforms say about the first seconds",
      "body": "TikTok's guidance for advertisers says to introduce a video's proposition in the first 3 seconds [1] and to put the hook in the first 6 seconds to boost engagement and watch time [2]. YouTube reports, for each Short, the percentage of times viewers viewed it versus swiped away [3]. For longer videos, its intro metric is the share of viewers still watching after 30 seconds [4]. See [[YouTube Shorts recommendations]].",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/creative-best-practices",
          "title": "Creative best practices for performance ads (TikTok Ads Help)",
          "quote": "Introduce your content proposition in the first 3 seconds for better recall and awareness"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/creative-best-practices",
          "title": "Creative best practices for performance ads (TikTok Ads Help)",
          "quote": "Prioritize your hook in the first 6 seconds to boost engagement and increase watch time"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/12942217?hl=en&co=YOUTUBE._YTVideoType%3Dshorts",
          "title": "Content tab analytics tips, Shorts (YouTube Help)",
          "quote": "Highlights the percentage of times that viewers viewed your Shorts versus swiped away"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9314415?hl=en",
          "title": "Measure key moments for audience retention (YouTube Help)",
          "quote": "Intro tells you what percentage of your audience still watched your video after the first 30 seconds"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Why the opening affects ranking",
      "body": "Feeds reward viewers who stay. TikTok counts finishing a longer video as a strong indicator of interest [1], and Instagram predicts how likely you are to watch a reel all the way through [2]; a viewer who swipes in the first seconds does neither. YouTube adds that a strong intro can mean the opening matched what the thumbnail and title promised [3]. See [[Watch time]] and [[TikTok For You feed]].",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://newsroom.tiktok.com/en-us/how-tiktok-recommends-videos-for-you",
          "title": "How TikTok recommends videos #ForYou (TikTok Newsroom, June 2020)",
          "quote": "A strong indicator of interest, such as whether a user finishes watching a longer video from beginning to end, would receive greater weight"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://about.instagram.com/blog/announcements/instagram-ranking-explained",
          "title": "Instagram Ranking Explained (Instagram, 2023)",
          "quote": "The most important predictions we make are how likely you are to reshare a reel, watch a reel all the way through"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9314415?hl=en",
          "title": "Measure key moments for audience retention (YouTube Help)",
          "quote": "The content in the first 30 seconds matched the viewer’s expectation of the video’s thumbnail and title"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "What a hook is made of",
      "body": "TikTok's ad guidance names the parts: suspense, surprise or other emotions [1], captions or text overlays for context, at 5 to 10 words per second [2][3], and transitions, stickers and graphics to hold attention [4]. YouTube's advice for a weak intro is to make the thumbnail and title match the video and to experiment with the first 30 seconds [5]. The figure below groups these into four kinds of opening.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/creative-best-practices",
          "title": "Creative best practices for performance ads (TikTok Ads Help)",
          "quote": "You can do so by creating suspense, surprise, or other emotions"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/creative-best-practices",
          "title": "Creative best practices for performance ads (TikTok Ads Help)",
          "quote": "Use captions or text overlays to provide context to your ad"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/creative-best-practices",
          "title": "Creative best practices for performance ads (TikTok Ads Help)",
          "quote": "We recommend displaying 5-10 words per second when using text"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/creative-best-practices",
          "title": "Creative best practices for performance ads (TikTok Ads Help)",
          "quote": "Utilize transitions, stickers, and graphics in your creative to retain engagement and view time"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/9314415?hl=en",
          "title": "Measure key moments for audience retention (YouTube Help)",
          "quote": "Modify the first 30 seconds of your video and experiment with different styles"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "heading": "Four kinds of opening",
      "body": "<style>\n.hf{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;font-family:var(--ow-font);color:var(--ow-fg)}\n.hf *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.hf-rule{position:relative;height:34px;margin:0 6px 10px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ow-fg)}\n.hf-rule span{position:absolute;bottom:-26px;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;font:600 13px/1 var(--ow-mono);color:var(--ow-muted)}\n.hf-rule span::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:50%;top:-10px;width:2px;height:8px;background:var(--ow-fg)}\n.hf-rule span:first-of-type{transform:none}.hf-rule span:first-of-type::before{left:0}\n.hf-rule span:last-of-type{transform:translateX(-100%)}.hf-rule span:last-of-type::before{left:auto;right:0}\n.hf-win{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:20px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in oklch,var(--ow-accent) 22%,transparent) 0 8px,transparent 8px 14px);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ow-fg)}\n.hf ol{list-style:none;margin:30px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}\n.hf li{padding:14px 14px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--ow-panel);border:1px solid var(--ow-line);border-top:4px solid var(--ow-accent)}\n.hf .ic{display:block;width:34px;height:34px;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--ow-accent)}\n.hf b{display:block;font-size:16px;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:5px}\n.hf li span.d{display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ow-muted)}\n.hf-foot{margin:14px 2px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ow-muted)}\n@media (max-width:780px){.hf ol{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media (max-width:440px){.hf ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hf li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;column-gap:12px}.hf .ic{margin:0;grid-row:span 2}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"hf\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The first three seconds of a short video, the window in which a viewer decides to keep watching or swipe, with four kinds of opening that platform guidance names: a visual change, text on screen, tension such as a question, and the promise of what the video delivers.\">\n  <div class=\"hf-rule\"><div class=\"hf-win\">the swipe window</div><span style=\"left:0\">0 s</span><span style=\"left:33.3%\">1 s</span><span style=\"left:66.6%\">2 s</span><span style=\"left:100%\">3 s</span></div>\n  <ol>\n    <li><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"7\" width=\"26\" height=\"20\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M13 4l-4 6M23 4l-4 6M4 13h26\"/></svg><b>Visual change</b><span class=\"d\">Motion, a cut, a transition, a sticker or a graphic on the very first frame.</span></li>\n    <li><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"26\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M10 14h14M10 20h9\"/></svg><b>Text on screen</b><span class=\"d\">A caption or overlay that says what this is, readable with the sound off.</span></li>\n    <li><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"13\"/><path d=\"M13 13.5a4 4 0 1 1 5.5 3.7c-1 .4-1.5 1.2-1.5 2.3v.5\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"24\" r=\".6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><b>Tension</b><span class=\"d\">A question, suspense or a surprise the viewer wants resolved.</span></li>\n    <li><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 17h20M19 10l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><b>Payoff promise</b><span class=\"d\">What the video delivers, matching what the title or thumbnail promised.</span></li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"hf-foot\">These are not steps in order: one opening can use several at once.</p>\n</div>\n"
    }
  ],
